      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Replicas are read-only and asynchronous: a paused replica still answered 2 orders after the 3rd committed\n(no read-your-writes), then caught up. With shard 1's primary down, its replicas keep answering and shard 0\nkeeps taking writes. Replicas scale reads only; writes scale by adding shards.",
      "originalText": "Replicas are read-only and asynchronous: a paused replica still answered 2 orders after the 3rd committed\n(no read-your-writes), then caught up. With shard 1's primary down, its replicas keep answering and shard 0\nkeeps taking writes. Replicas scale reads only; writes scale by adding shards.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
